xinput1_3, sechost: Read controllers from the app.

XInput reads the app's controller snapshot through the gamepad
information class (KITSUNE_GAMEPAD_INFO_CLASS, ios_gamepad.h), traced
with KITSUNE_XINPUT_TRACE. It reports a neutral pad until Dark Souls:
Remastered's control bindings are ready. sechost sends device notifications
when a controller connects or disconnects.
---
